  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "SECURITY LOG: #42-B STATION: OFFICER: K. JENSEN\n\nSTATUS: CRITICAL ERROR\n\nLOG
    CONTENT: The power grid in the Cafeteria is failing. Someone \u2014 or something
    \u2014 is chewing through the cables in the vents. It\u2019s not just the hull
    cooling down anymore. We can hear them...\n\nThey aren't just scratching. They
    are mimicking. Yesterday I heard the sound of a hydraulic door opening in Sector
    B, but when I checked the monitors, the sector was empty. It\u2019s trying to
    lure us out.\n\nIf you are reading this, do NOT follow the sounds. Do not trust
    the station's automated signals.\n\nI don't know what happened to Officer Tyler.
    He was in the Security Module when the screaming started. Tyler, if you can hear
    this through the internal comms \u2014 stay locked in. Do not open the blast
    doors for anyone. Not even for me.\n\nWe brought IT on board to study IT. That
    was our biggest mistake. It\u2019s awake now. Everyone in the Command Module
    is gone.\n\nIf you can reach the escape pods, you need to manually override the\u2014
    [SYSTEM ERROR] [SIGNAL LOST]\n\nhsdghasdbglhw4590t834t... IT IS BEHIND THE SCREEN
    DO NOT LOOK UP asdgashdg..."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
